Fire!

303
00:19:22,399 --> 00:19:23,399
Don't let them get through that gate!

304
00:19:24,399 --> 00:19:25,399
Blow them to smotheries!

305
00:19:26,399 --> 00:19:27,399
Run!

306
00:19:27,399 --> 00:19:28,399
Mr. Two!

307
00:19:28,399 --> 00:19:30,399
This is it! The gate's about to close!

308
00:19:31,399 --> 00:19:34,399
This is it! The gate's about to close!

309
00:19:38,399 --> 00:19:41,399
We have... to go!

310
00:19:48,399 --> 00:19:50,399
So thank you!

311
00:19:58,399 --> 00:19:59,399
We'll never forget you!

312
00:20:00,399 --> 00:20:01,399
We'll never forget you!

313
00:20:01,399 --> 00:20:02,399
We'll never forget you!

314
00:20:05,399 --> 00:20:06,399
Oh, my God!

315
00:20:13,399 --> 00:20:14,399
Straw boy!

316
00:20:14,399 --> 00:20:15,399
I'm here!

317
00:20:15,399 --> 00:20:16,399
Straw boy!

318
00:20:17,399 --> 00:20:18,399
Find Ace! Save him!

319
00:20:19,399 --> 00:20:20,399
And don't look back!

320
00:20:20,399 --> 00:20:21,399
I know you can do it!

321
00:20:22,399 --> 00:20:23,399
And you have lots of friends to help you!

322
00:20:24,399 --> 00:20:25,399
Fine!

323
00:20:26,399 --> 00:20:27,399
The gate is closing!

324
00:20:28,399 --> 00:20:29,399
Keep firing!

325
00:20:29,399 --> 00:20:30,399
Take them out!

326
00:20:31,399 --> 00:20:32,399
Did you miss me, old pal?

327
00:20:33,399 --> 00:20:34,399
Yeah, we did!

328
00:20:34,399 --> 00:20:35,399
We really did it!

329
00:20:35,399 --> 00:20:39,399
Oh, stop pulling my tail!

330
00:20:40,399 --> 00:20:45,399
Straw boy, I'm here to rescue you!

331
00:20:46,399 --> 00:20:47,399
Oh, my God!

332
00:20:48,399 --> 00:20:49,399
I've got you down!

333
00:20:50,399 --> 00:20:51,399
The gate is closing!

334
00:20:51,399 --> 00:20:53,399
Keep firing!

335
00:20:53,399 --> 00:20:54,399
Take them out!

336
00:20:55,399 --> 00:20:56,399
Did you miss me, old pal?

337
00:20:57,399 --> 00:20:58,399
Yeah, we did it!

338
00:20:58,399 --> 00:20:59,399
We really did it!

339
00:21:00,399 --> 00:21:01,399
Oh, stop pulling my tail!

340
00:21:02,399 --> 00:21:03,399
Straw boy, I've come here to rescue you!

341
00:21:04,399 --> 00:21:08,399
In the name of our ever-lasting friendship!

342
